{"seq":3,"slug":"awk","title":"awk 编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/shell-scripting/text-processing/awk","wordCount":818,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"awk-编程\">awk 编程</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>awk 是一种功能完备的文本处理语言，以其发明者 Aho、Weinberger 和 Kernighan 三人姓氏首字母命名。与 grep 的行匹配和 sed 的流编辑不同，awk 的核心能力在于结构化文本处理——它天然理解字段（列）的概念，将每行输入自动拆分为字段，并提供完整的编程结构（变量、数组、函数、控制流）进行数据处理。</p>\n<p>awk 程序由一组&quot;模式-动作&quot;规则组成：<code>pattern { action }</code>。对于输入的每一行，awk 依次检查所有规则，如果行匹配模式，则执行对应的动作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[awk 执行流程] --&gt; B[&quot;BEGIN { } 初始化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[读取一行输入]&#10;    C --&gt; D[自动拆分为字段]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;$0=整行 $1=第一字段 $NF=最后字段&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{逐个检查 pattern}&#10;    F --&gt;|匹配| G[执行 action]&#10;    F --&gt;|不匹配| H[检查下一个 pattern]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{还有输入?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| C&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[&quot;END { } 收尾&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[awk 执行流程] --&gt; B[\"BEGIN { } 初始化\"]\n    B --&gt; C[读取一行输入]\n    C --&gt; D[自动拆分为字段]\n    D --&gt; E[\"$0=整行 $1=第一字段 $NF=最后字段\"]\n    E --&gt; F{逐个检查 pattern}\n    F --&gt;|匹配| G[执行 action]\n    F --&gt;|不匹配| H[检查下一个 pattern]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{还有输入?}\n    I --&gt;|是| C\n    I --&gt;|否| J[\"END { } 收尾\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>grep</th>\n<th>sed</th>\n<th>awk</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>核心能力</td>\n<td>行匹配</td>\n<td>流编辑</td>\n<td>数据处理</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段处理</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>表格数据用 awk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编程能力</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>极有限</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>复杂逻辑用 awk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数学运算</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>统计计算用 awk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正则匹配</td>\n<td>核心</td>\n<td>核心</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>纯搜索用 grep</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行内编辑</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>核心</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>替换用 sed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"字段处理与内置变量\">字段处理与内置变量</h2><p>awk 将输入行自动按分隔符拆分为字段，这是其最强大的特性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &quot;John 28 Engineer&quot; | awk &#39;{print $1, $3}&#39;&#10;&#10;awk -F: &#39;{print $1, $3, $7}&#39; /etc/passwd&#10;&#10;awk -F&#39;,&#39; &#39;{print $2, $4}&#39; data.csv&#10;&#10;awk &#39;{print $NF}&#39; file.txt       # 最后一个字段&#10;awk &#39;{print $(NF-1)}&#39; file.txt   # 倒数第二个字段&#10;&#10;echo &quot;a:b:c:d&quot; | awk -F: &#39;{&#10;    for (i = 1; i &lt;= NF; i++)&#10;        print &quot;字段&quot; i &quot;: &quot; $i&#10;}&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;hello world&quot; | awk &#39;{$2 = &quot;awk&quot;; print $0}&#39;&#10;&#10;ps aux | awk &#39;{printf &quot;%-10s %5s %s\\n&quot;, $1, $2, $11}&#39;&#10;&#10;ls -la | awk &#39;NR &gt; 1 {total += $5} END {print &quot;总大小:&quot;, total, &quot;bytes&quot;}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"John 28 Engineer\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $3}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $3, $7}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/passwd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $2, $4}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> data.csv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $NF}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 最后一个字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $(NF-1)}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 倒数第二个字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"a:b:c:d\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    for (i = 1; i &#x3C;= NF; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        print \"字段\" i \": \" $i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello world\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{$2 = \"awk\"; print $0}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ps</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aux</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{printf \"%-10s %5s %s\\n\", $1, $2, $11}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -la</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NR > 1 {total += $5} END {print \"总大小:\", total, \"bytes\"}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>awk 的内置变量提供了丰富的上下文信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>$0</code> / <code>$1..$NF</code></td>\n<td>整行 / 各字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NR</code> / <code>FNR</code></td>\n<td>全局行号 / 当前文件行号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NF</code></td>\n<td>当前行字段数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FS</code> / <code>OFS</code></td>\n<td>输入 / 输出字段分隔符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RS</code> / <code>ORS</code></td>\n<td>输入 / 输出记录分隔符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FILENAME</code></td>\n<td>当前处理的文件名</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"内置变量示例\">内置变量示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"awk &#39;{&#10;    print &quot;行号:&quot;, NR&#10;    print &quot;文件行号:&quot;, FNR&#10;    print &quot;字段数:&quot;, NF&#10;    print &quot;当前文件:&quot;, FILENAME&#10;    print &quot;字段分隔符:&quot;, FS&#10;    print &quot;输出分隔符:&quot;, OFS&#10;    print &quot;记录分隔符:&quot;, RS&#10;}&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;awk &#39;BEGIN {&#10;    FS = &quot;,&quot;&#10;    OFS = &quot;\\t&quot;&#10;}&#10;{&#10;    print $1, $2, $3&#10;}&#39; data.csv&#10;&#10;awk &#39;BEGIN {&#10;    RS = &quot;&quot;      # 空行作为记录分隔符（段落模式）&#10;    FS = &quot;\\n&quot;    # 换行作为字段分隔符&#10;}&#10;{&#10;    print &quot;段落&quot;, NR, &quot;:&quot;&#10;    for (i = 1; i &lt;= NF; i++)&#10;        print &quot;  行&quot;, i, &quot;:&quot;, $i&#10;}&#39; paragraphs.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"行号:\", NR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"文件行号:\", FNR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"字段数:\", NF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"当前文件:\", FILENAME</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"字段分隔符:\", FS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"输出分隔符:\", OFS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"记录分隔符:\", RS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BEGIN {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FS = \",\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    OFS = \"\\t\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print $1, $2, $3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> data.csv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BEGIN {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RS = \"\"      # 空行作为记录分隔符（段落模式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FS = \"\\n\"    # 换行作为字段分隔符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    print \"段落\", NR, \":\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    for (i = 1; i &#x3C;= NF; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        print \"  行\", i, \":\", $i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> paragraphs.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模式匹配与条件过滤\">模式匹配与条件过滤</h2><h3 id=\"模式类型\">模式类型</h3><p>awk 的模式可以是正则表达式、条件表达式或特殊模式（BEGIN/END）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"awk &#39;/error/&#39; log.txt&#10;&#10;awk &#39;!/^#/ &amp;&amp; !/^$/&#39; config.txt&#10;&#10;awk &#39;$3 &gt; 1000&#39; data.txt&#10;&#10;awk -F: &#39;$3 &gt;= 1000 &amp;&amp; $7 ~ /bash/&#39; /etc/passwd&#10;&#10;awk &#39;$0 ~ /pattern/&#39; file.txt&#10;awk &#39;$2 ~ /^[A-Z]/&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;awk &#39;/START/,/END/&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;awk &#39;NR &gt;= 10 &amp;&amp; NR &lt;= 20&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;awk &#39;NR == 1 || $3 &gt; 100&#39; data.c